# Title: Suspicious Uninstall of Windows Defender Feature via PowerShell
# ID: c443012c-7928-43bf-ac20-7eda5efe61ad
# Status: experimental
# Level: high
# Author: yxinmiracle
# Date: 2025-08-22
# Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
# Description: Detects the use of PowerShell with Uninstall-WindowsFeature or Remove-WindowsFeature cmdlets to disable or remove the Windows Defender GUI feature, a common technique used by adversaries to evade defenses.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process.command_line:*Windows-Defender*) AND ((process.command_line:*Uninstall-WindowsFeature* OR process.command_line:*Remove-WindowsFeature*)) AND (((process.executable:*\\powershell_ise.exe OR process.executable:*\\powershell.exe OR process.executable:*\\pwsh.exe)) OR ((process.pe.original_file_name:"PowerShell_ISE.EXE" OR process.pe.original_file_name:"PowerShell.EXE" OR process.pe.original_file_name:"pwsh.dll"))))
